  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\n- Khi m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng
    minh ch\u1EBFt, h\xFAt 1 m\xE1u t\u1EEB ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\u1ED1i
    th\u1EE7 cho b\u1EA1n."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 ma c\xE0n s\xF9ng \u2014 y\xEAu qu\xE1i gi\u1ED1ng d\u01A1i
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ghi trong chuy\u1EC7n v\xF9ng H\u01B0ng H\xF3a. Ban \u0111\xEAm
    ta bay \u0111i h\xFAt m\xE1u b\xE0 \u0111\u1EBB; b\u1EDFi v\u1EADy nh\xE0 c\xF3
    s\u1EA3n ph\u1EE5 x\u01B0a th\u01B0\u1EDDng canh \u0111\xE8n v\xE0 gi\u0103ng
    l\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EC1 ph\xF2ng."
